C4 Level 3 – Component Diagram
Core Application API (.NET Backend)
This is the business core of Infrastructure Copilot.
While the AI Orchestrator is responsible for reasoning, retrieval orchestration, citations, and model interaction, the Core Application API owns the business domains:

Incident Intelligence
Change Intelligence
Knowledge Intelligence
Configuration Management
Tenant Management
Audit & Compliance
Reporting & Analytics

This architecture aligns with enterprise AI patterns that emphasize governance, service management, operational intelligence, observability, service reliability engineering, AI-assisted incident management, and secure enterprise operations. [CIS Overview 2026 | PowerPoint], [AI in ITSM | SharePoint], [Microsoft...Architects | SharePoint]

